{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019BXYJNgtBv3Aft3h1u8RBW","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contamcal-irt-calibration — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 00:05 UTC | 更新原因: D036: ARC negative gamma confirmed, coverage collapse 20-33%, 跨种子方差 7pp, 优先级重排\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nContamCal：post-hoc statistical calibration via contamination-augmented 4PL IRT。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25**（D006, 距今 10 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）+ 审稿进行中\\\\n- **D036 关键发现**: ARC gamma 负方向 confirmed（3 条独立证据链）→ framing 调整为 benchmark-dependent effects\\\\n- **Coverage collapse**: 20-33% 即使 oracle，PPP 极值 → 模型可能错误指定，调查中\\\\n- **跨种子方差**: 0.5B d100 ARC 7.25pp（s42 vs s123）→ multi-seed pooling 必要条件\\\\n- **Scale story**: 3B d100 ARC=84% vs 0.5B d100=29-37%，scale 显著缓解 contamination forgetting\\\\n\\\\n**SFT 进度 (seed=42)**:\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | d000 | d005 | d025 | d100 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 0.5B | ✅ | ✅ | ❌(2x fail) | ✅ |\\\\n| 1.5B | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\\\\n| 3B | ✅(v2) | P2 | P4 | 🏃(v2) |\\\\n\\\\n**SFT 进度 (seed=123)**:\\\\n\\\\n| 模型 | d000 | d005 | d025 | d100 |\\\\n|------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| 0.5B | ✅ | 🏃(GPU 1) | — | ✅(eval done) |\\\\n| 1.5B | ✅ | — | — | 🏃(GPU 2) |\\\\n| 3B | 🏃(v2, GPU 5) | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n**Signal (exp-002)**: 0.5B ✅ | 1.5B ✅ (12/12 PASS) | 3B 未开始\\\\n**CPU**: exp-004 v3 ~45% | exp-005 v4 ~92%\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ Critical Issues (D036)\\\\n1. **Coverage collapse 20-33%** — PPP=1.0(ARC)/0.0(GSM8K)，4PL+γ additive 模型可能不够。调查路径：(a) N↑ via multi-seed (b) exp-004 at matching N (c) 更灵活 IRT 结构\\\\n2. **Oracle vs RRF 比较混淆** — N_models 15 vs 8，需匹配 N=8 重跑 oracle\\\\n3. **GSM8K oracle 诊断 FAIL** — rhat=1.012/ESS=345，需 warmup=2000/samples=2000\\\\n4. **train_sft.py --gpu 死代码** — args.gpu 解析但未用，需修复\\\\n\\\\n## Critical Path\\\\n```\\\\n🔴 Coverage collapse 调查 ← 最高优先级\\\\n  → exp-004 sweep coverage 数据（45% done）\\\\n  → seed=123 完成后 N≥16 pooled IRT 重跑 → 检查 coverage 是否改善\\\\n  → 如果 N↑ 仍不够 → 考虑 model misspecification fix\\\\n\\\\n并行: seed=123 SFT (GPU 1/2/5)\\\\n并行: 3B d100 v2 SFT (GPU 3)\\\\n并行: train_sft.py --gpu 修复\\\\n并行: oracle N=8 matched 重跑 + GSM8K 更长 chains\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] ⚡ Coverage collapse 根因分析（exp-004 sweep 覆盖率 + PPP 诊断）\\\\n- [ ] seed=123 SFT 完成 → N≥16 multi-seed pooled IRT\\\\n- [ ] train_sft.py --gpu 死代码修复\\\\n- [ ] Oracle matched N=8 重跑（公平对比 RRF）\\\\n- [ ] GSM8K oracle warmup=2000/samples=2000 重跑\\\\n- [ ] 3B d100 v2 完成 → eval → 加入 pooled IRT\\\\n- [ ] d000 baseline gap 分析（ConStat delta-of-deltas）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 6× RTX 4090D, 全项目分配\\\\n- 6/6 满载 ✅\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-15 | Paper framing pivot: 从 \\\\\\\"calibration method\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"de | exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2, exp006-oracle-arc-2pl, exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2, exp006-pooled-arc |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-15 | Oracle GSM8K γ=+3.77 显著但校准反而更差——论文需要从\\\\\\\"calibration  | exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2, exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2, exp006-pooled-arc |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-15 | ARC negative gamma + coverage collapse + 跨种子方差：三大发 | exp006-oracle-arc, exp006-oracle-gsm8k, exp_001_eval_05B_d100_s123_aligned, exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-14 | Oracle baseline 确认 benchmark-dependent contaminati | exp006-oracle-arc, exp006-oracle-gsm8k, exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf, exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-14 | Exposure source 切回 S1-only，废弃 RRF fusion 作为 per-mo | exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v2, exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf, exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf, D031 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-14 | D032 结果需纠偏: Agent 审计发现 pooled IRT 6 个严重问题——coverag | exp_006_irt_05B_v2, exp-004 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-14 | Pooled IRT N=8 首次结果: ARC γ=-1.46 显著负(CI排除0), GSM8K | exp_006_irt_05B_v2, exp-001, exp-002 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-14 | exp_006 pooled IRT v2 exposure 仅用 s1_embedding，违反  | exp_006 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-14 | 弃用 S3 ConStat 信号，论文只报告 3-signal RRF (S1 embedding  | exp_002_constat, exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch, exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-14 | Paraphrase gap 不可作为原始污染信号；ConStat 风格分析必须用 delta-of | exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch, exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch, exp_002_constat |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3845, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQN1cdAzGRK2XNp9CA9YL1","session_id":"9513347c-0cdf-4b9b-9658-b8164fba2e34","uuid":"9c332fe5-4eee-49aa-9664-1f86cdf9b785","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:23:21.688Z"}
